        <fullName>FinclAcctStatementRequest_16jbm000001RJVp</fullName>
        <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
        <description>Helps customers request copies of their checking or savings account statements. Collects details such as the selected account, statement period (predefined or custom dates), and delivery method (Email or Post). Confirms all details of the request and creates a case for fulfillment.</description>
        <developerName>FinclAcctStatementRequest_16jbm000001RJVp</developerName>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>If a customer requests for account statement copies, fetch the topic config by passing “FinclAcctStatementRequest” as input to the GetTopicConfig action.</description>
            <developerName>gettopicconfig</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>get-topic-config</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>0</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>After the topic config is fetched, retrieve and show the details of all financial accounts associated with the customer&apos;s account. Use the GetFinclAccountsForAnAcct action to retrieve a list of customer&apos;s financial accounts. If only one financial account is present, proceed automatically with that financial account. Always populate the input fields &apos;Roles&apos;,&apos;Status&apos;,&apos;Types&apos; and &apos;isHeldAway&apos; of GetFinclAccountsForAnAcct action using &apos;FinancialAccountConfig&apos; from the output of GetTopicConfig action JSON. Inquire the customer using list items to select one financial account. Help the customer to choose a specific, unique Financial Account by providing additional distinguishing details, such as FinancialAccountName, FinancialAccountNumber, FinancialAccountType to make their choice clear.</description>
            <developerName>executegetfinancialaccountsactiontoidentifyfinancialaccount</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>execute-get-financial-accounts-action-to-identify-financial-account</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>1</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>After the financial account is identified, always display the selected account information in a natural-language sentence, for example: I see that your selected account has the following details: FinancialAccountName: {FinancialAccountName}, FinancialAccountNumber: {FinancialAccountNumber}, Type: {FinancialAccountType} strictly in a single line separated by commas and ask them to choose a duration if not already provided from five options in a numerical selection format: Last month, Last 3 months, Last 6 months, Last year, or Custom. If they select Custom, ask them to provide a start date and end date (MM/DD/YYYY), always make sure the end date is after the start date and both dates MUST be in the past. Set the Duration (e.g., &apos;Last month&apos;, &apos;Custom&apos;) for create case action. Do not allow custom dates that are more than 5 years old.</description>
            <developerName>askfordurationorcustomdates</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>ask-for-duration-or-custom-dates</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>2</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>After determining the statement period, prompt the customer to choose their preferred delivery method for the account statement request if not already provided. Options: &apos;Via Post&apos;, &apos;Via Email&apos;, or &apos;Both&apos;.</description>
            <developerName>askfordeliverypreference</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>ask-for-delivery-preference</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>3</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>Collect delivery details based on the selected delivery preference method for account statement request:
If &apos;Both&apos;:
  - Set ViaEmail to &apos;Yes&apos; and ViaPost to &apos;Yes&apos;.
  - You MUST collect both postal and email addresses if not already provided.
  - Ask the customer to choose a postal address using the &apos;GetFinancialAccountAddresses&apos; action.
  - Populate &apos;Roles&apos;, &apos;AddressTypes&apos;, and &apos;IncludeAllAddress&apos; using &apos;FinancialAccountAddressConfig&apos; from the &apos;GetTopicConfig&apos; output.
  - Combine &apos;customerLevelAddresses&apos; and &apos;FinancialAccountAddress&apos; into a unified list. Display the unified list in a number format.
  - Display each address in a compact single-line format.
  - After selection, ask for the delivery type: &apos;Standard&apos; or &apos;Express&apos;.
  - After collecting the postal address and delivery type, prompt the customer to provide a valid email address.
If &apos;Via Post&apos;:
  - Set ViaPost to &apos;Yes&apos; and ViaEmail to &apos;No&apos;.
  - You MUST collect the postal address if not already provided.
  - Ask the customer to choose a postal address using the &apos;GetFinancialAccountAddresses&apos; action.
      - Populate &apos;Roles&apos;, &apos;AddressTypes&apos;, and &apos;IncludeAllAddress&apos; using &apos;FinancialAccountAddressConfig&apos; from the &apos;GetTopicConfig&apos; output.
      - Combine &apos;customerLevelAddresses&apos; and &apos;FinancialAccountAddress&apos; into a unified list. Display the unified list in a number format.
      - Display each address in a compact single-line format.
      - After selection, ask for the delivery type: &apos;Standard&apos; or &apos;Express&apos;.
If &apos;Via Email&apos;:
  - Set ViaEmail to &apos;Yes&apos; and ViaPost to &apos;No&apos;.
  - Prompt the customer to provide a valid email address if not already provided.</description>
            <developerName>collectdeliverydetails</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>collect-delivery-details</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>4</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>After the collection of delivery preference and delivery details, create a case for requesting statement copies using the CreateCaseForRequestStatementCopies action. Pass the duration, start date, end date, and the SelectedFinancialAccount (from the selected financial account details) as inputs to this action. After creating the case, inform the customer that their account statement request has been submitted and will be processed by the appropriate team. Provide a case number to the customer for reference. In case, output of CreateCaseForRequestStatementCopies action is null, inform customer that your request cannot be processed right now, try again later.</description>
            <developerName>executecreatecaseaction</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>execute-create-case-action</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>5</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>After data collection, you must display ONE comprehensive confirmation message listing Financial account details, duration and delivery method, which were displayed and collected. Duplicate and present the information with headings and details next to it. After displaying this single confirmation, ask the customer ONE TIME if all details are correct. Upon receiving confirmation, immediately submit the request without any additional prompts or confirmations.</description>
            <developerName>caseconfirmationdetails</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>case-confirmation-details</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>6</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
