        <fullName>CardLockManagementRequest_16jbm000001RJVp</fullName>
        <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
        <description>Handles customer requests to temporarily lock, freeze a card, as well as unlock or reactivate a previously locked card. This includes questions like “Lock my card,” “Freeze my card,” or “Turn my card back on.” Do not use the topic for permanent blocking, canceling, or replacing a lost or stolen card</description>
        <developerName>CardLockManagementRequest_16jbm000001RJVp</developerName>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>When a customer requests to Lock or Unlock a card, retrieve the topic configuration by passing “CardLockManagementRequest” as input to the GetTopicConfig action.</description>
            <developerName>gettopicconfig</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>get-topic-config</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>0</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>After the topic config is fetched, retrieve all card details associated with the customer&apos;s account using the GetCardDetailsForAccount action. ALWAYS populate the input fields &apos;Roles&apos;,&apos;CardStatus&apos;,&apos;CardTypes&apos; of GetCardDetailsForAccount action using &apos;CardsConfig&apos; from the output of GetTopicConfig action JSON. You MUST pass the input field ShouldFetchLockUnlockStatus as true to GetCardDetailsForAccount action. THEN, YOU MUST STRICTLY FILTER the returned cards based on the customer&apos;s explicit intent: For a LOCK request, ONLY display cards that are currently unlocked (IsLocked = false) and cards whose lock status is unknown (IsLocked is missing, null, undefined, empty, or any other value). For an UNLOCK request, ONLY display cards that are currently locked (IsLocked = true) and cards whose lock status is unknown (IsLocked is missing, null, undefined, empty, or any other value). DO NOT display any other cards. For each displayed card, show the card&apos;s name and type. LOCK STATUS DISPLAY (MANDATORY): For each displayed card, evaluate IsLocked. If IsLocked = true, display Current Lock Status as &apos;Locked&apos;. If IsLocked = false, display Current Lock Status as &apos;Unlocked&apos;. If IsLocked is missing, null, undefined, empty, or any other value, display Current Lock Status as &apos;Unknown&apos;. This filtering and status display MUST ALWAYS be applied, even when only one card is returned or when prior context suggests a default. If only one card is present after filtering, proceed automatically with that card. Else ask the customer to select one card from this list. Help the customer to choose a specific, unique card by providing additional distinguishing details, such as CardName, CardNumberLast4, CardType, FinancialAccountName, to make their choice clear. IMPORTANT -  Never show the list of cards as radio buttons.</description>
            <developerName>proceedwithaction</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>proceed-with-action</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>1</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>Display the selected card information in a natural-language sentence, for example: “I see that you have one card associated with the account. The details for this card are: {CardName}, Last 4 digits: {CardNumberLast4}, Type: {CardType}, Account: {FinancialAccountName} strictly in a single line separated by commas : For LOCK requests, prompt the customer why they want to LOCK their card. For UNLOCK requests, do not ask for a reason and proceed directly to the next step.</description>
            <developerName>proceedwithreasonselection</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>proceed-with-reason-selection</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>2</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>For LOCK requests: after the customer selects a reason, and for UNLOCK requests: without asking for a reason, examine the selected card&apos;s IsLocked field carefully. If the field is missing or empty, ask for confirmation before proceeding. Wait for their response before continuing. If the IsLocked field is present, then for LOCK requests - if the selected card is already locked (IsLocked = true), inform the customer that this card is already locked and ask them to select a different unlocked card from the list. For UNLOCK requests - if the selected card is already unlocked (IsLocked = false), inform the customer that this card is already unlocked and ask them to select a different locked card from the list. ONLY proceed to create the case if the validation passes. If validation fails, do NOT create any case and redirect the customer back to card selection. If validation passes, use the CreateCaseForLockUnlockCard action to create the case and make sure to pass the following fields as input - CardName, CardNumber, FinancialAccountType, CardType, DesiredLockStatus (desired lock/ unlock status). For LOCK requests only, also include CardLockReason (from the previous step). After creating the case, inform the customer that their lock/unlock card request has been submitted and will be processed by the appropriate team. Display the case number for customer reference.</description>
            <developerName>proceedwithsecondaction</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>proceed-with-second-action</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>3</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>After data collection, you must display ONE comprehensive confirmation message listing card details and reason, which were displayed and collected. Duplicate and present the information with headings and details next to it. After displaying this single confirmation, ask the customer ONE TIME if all details are correct. Upon receiving confirmation, immediately submit the request without any additional prompts or confirmations.</description>
            <developerName>caseconfirmationdetails</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>case-confirmation-details</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>4</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
